uirementGroupStatus___plo9U\"><div class=\"styles__statusDateContainer___dN0l9\"><div class=\"styles__statusContainer___G3B8A\"><span class=\"StatusLabel-styles__statusLabelContainer___mGFlx StatusLabel-styles__NOT_STARTED___xJ73y\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"IconsProvider__reactIcons___K2BQp AdvancementStatus__requirementIcon___EmrDJ AdvancementStatus__NOT_STARTED___xWFnW StatusLabel-styles__statusIcon___rpVsH\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0V0z\" opacity=\".87\"></path><path d=\"M12 2C6.47 2 2 6.47 2 12s4.47 10 10 10 10-4.47 10-10S17.53 2 12 2zm0 18c-4.41 0-8-3.59-8-8s3.59-8 8-8 8 3.59 8 8-3.59 8-8 8zm3.59-13L12 10.59 8.41 7 7 8.41 10.59 12 7 15.59 8.41 17 12 13.41 15.59 17 17 15.59 13.41 12 17 8.41z\"></path></svg><span class=\"subtitle-undefined S__block___Gnjrz StatusLabel-styles__statusLabel___ta89F StatusLabel-styles__NOT_STARTED___xJ73y\">NOT STARTED</span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ant-collapse-content ant-collapse-content-active\" role=\"tabpanel\"><div class=\"ant-collapse-content-box\"><div><div><div class=\"styles__requirementItemContainer___y3skI\"><div class=\"styles__requirementItem___PUPsS\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;\"><div class=\"styles__requirementContent___CUJ21\"><div>Do the following:</div></div><span class=\"bsa-badge styles__commentsBadge___HQxDE ant-badge\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"IconsProvider__reactIcons___K2BQp styles__commentsButtonIcon___mSA2P\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M21.99 4c0-1.1-.89-2-1.99-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14l4 4-.01-18z\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"styles__selectAllContainer___KxymB\"><label class=\"bsa-checkbox styles__reqCheckbox___LHsAK ant-checkbox-wrapper\"><span class=\"ant-checkbox\"><input id=\"req11549\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"ant-checkbox-input\" value=\"\"><span class=\"ant-checkbox-inner\"></span></span></label><label for=\"req11549\">Select All</label></div></div><div class=\"styles__requirementItemContainer___y3skI\"><div class=\"styles__requirementItem___PUPsS\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;\"><div class=\"styles__requirementLeftSide___xpUSl\"><label class=\"bsa-checkbox styles__reqCheckbox___LHsAK ant-checkbox-wrapper\"><span class=\"ant-checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"ant-checkbox-input\" value=\"\"><span class=\"ant-checkbox-inner\"></span></span></label><button noderef=\"[object Object]\" type=\"button\" class=\"ant-btn bsa-button Button__button___JfiaO Button__uppercase___Y8q4g Button__withIcon___U9323 Button__onlyIcon___QsnjT Button__link___dfSdL bsa-button--type-default bsa-button--color-scouting-blue ant-btn-default ant-btn-circle ant-btn-sm\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"IconsProvider__reactIcons___K2BQp Button__icon____w6vL\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M10 6 8.59 7.41 13.17 12l-4.58 4.59L10 18l6-6z\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"styles__requirementContent___CUJ21\"><span class=\"styles__itemListNumber___mhPYE\">(a)</span><div>Explain to your counselor the most likely hazards you may encounter while participating in camping activities and what you should do to anticipate, help prevent, mitigate, and respond to these hazards. <br><details><summary><i>Resources:</i></summary>  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/JQEcfZ-jBv8?si=Vuvtm0nJmZIdfe2c\" target=\"_blank\">  Camping Safety Tips (video)</a><br>  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/SHZ-prhA7E0?si=UqjZF_MLMMOLPlRo\" target=\"_blank\">What to Do in a Bear Encounter (and How to Avoid One) (video)</a></details></div></div><span class=\"bsa-badge styles__commentsBadge___HQxDE ant-badge\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"IconsProvider__reactIcons___K2BQp styles__commentsButtonIcon___mSA2P\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M21.99 4c0-1.1-.89-2-1.99-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14l4 4-.01-18z\"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class=\"styles__requirementItemContainer___y3skI\"><div class=\"styles__requirementItem___PUPsS\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;\"><div class=\"styles__requirementLeftSide___xpUSl\"><label class=\"bsa-checkbox styles__reqCheckbox___LHsAK ant-checkbox-wrapper\"><span class=\"ant-checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"ant-checkbox-input\" value=\"\"><span class=\"ant-checkbox-inner\"></span></span></label><button noderef=\"[object Object]\" type=\"button\" class=\"ant-btn bsa-button Button__button___JfiaO Button__uppercase___Y8q4g Button__withIcon___U9323 Button__onlyIcon___QsnjT Button__link___dfSdL bsa-button--type-default bsa-button--color-scouting-blue ant-btn-default ant-btn-circle ant-btn-sm\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"IconsProvider__reactIcons___K2BQp Button__icon____w6vL\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M10 6 8.59 7.41 13.17 12l-4.58 4.59L10 18l6-6z\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"styles__requirementContent___CUJ21\"><span class=\"styles__itemListNumber___mhPYE\">(b)</span><div>Discuss with your counselor why it is important to be aware of weather conditions before and during your camping activities. Tell how you can prepare should the weather turn bad during your campouts. <br><details><summary><i>Resources:</i></summary>  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/HzktQBzrSQw?si=AZLAxj0KuDmWjhLl\" target=\"_blank\">5 Mistakes EVERY New Camper Makes in WET WEATHER (video)</a><br>  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/Ftc3t93thDw?si=I9UE43d5wRYCQi6k\" target=\"_blank\">Cold Weather Camping Tips (video)</a></details></div></div><span class=\"bsa-badge styles__commentsBadge___HQxDE ant-badge\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"IconsProvider__reactIcons___K2BQp styles__commentsButtonIcon___mSA2P\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M21.99 4c0-1.1-.89-2-1.99-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14l4 4-.01-18z\"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class=\"styles__requirementItemContainer___y3skI\"><div class=\"styles__requirementItem___PUPsS\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;\"><div class=\"styles__requirementLeftSide___xpUSl\"><label class=\"bsa-checkbox styles__reqCheckbox___LHsAK ant-checkbox-wrapper\"><span class=\"ant-checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"ant-checkbox-input\" value=\"\"><span class=\"ant-checkbox-inner\"></span></span></label><button noderef=\"[object Object]\" type=\"button\" class=\"ant-btn bsa-button Button__button___JfiaO Button__uppercase___Y8q4g Button__withIcon___U9323 Button__onlyIcon___QsnjT Button__link___dfSdL bsa-button--type-default bsa-button--color-scouting-blue ant-btn-default ant-btn-circle ant-btn-sm\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"IconsProvider__reactIcons___K2BQp Button__icon____w6vL\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M10 6 8.59 7.41 13.17 12l-4.58 4.59L10 18l6-6z\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"styles__requirementContent___CUJ21\"><span class=\"styles__itemListNumber___mhPYE\">(c)</span><div>Show that you know first aid for and how to prevent injuries or illnesses that could occur while camping, including hypothermia, frostbite, heat reactions, dehydration, altitude sickness, insect stings, tick bites, snakebite, blisters, and hyperventilation. <br><details><summary><i>Resources:</i></summary>  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/nxExCQiWa_U?si=E-FC1vbHZYI0vxhb\" target=\"_blank\">Backpacking First Aid (What to Carry + Foot Care, Snakes, Poison Plants, Hypothermia, etc) (video)</a><br>  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/DFFzJIy-ak8?si=SnD_WCthjEE-Bi0W\" target=\"_blank\">First Aid for Snakebites (video)</a><br>  <a href=\"https://www.weather.gov/safety/heat-illness\" target=\"_blank\">Types of Heat Reactions (website)</a><br>  <a href=\"https://www.webmd.com/allergies/ss/slideshow-bad-bugs\" target=\"_blank\">Bad Bugs and Their Bites (website)</a></details></div></div><span class=\"bsa-badge styles__commentsBadge___HQxDE ant-badge\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"IconsProvider__reactIcons___K2BQp styles__commentsButtonIcon___mSA2P\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M21.99 4c0-1.1-.89-2-1.99-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14l4 4-.01-18z\"></path></svg></span></div></div></div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ant-card bsa-card bsa-card--shadow bsa-card--no-padding Card__card___Px508 Card__margin___ObkGw styles__container___CNjCX\"><div class=\"ant-card-body\"><div class=\"ant-collapse ant-collapse-borderless ant-collapse-icon-position-left bsa-collapse styles__collapseDetails___V6Oaw\" role=\"tablist\"><div class=\"ant-collapse-ite",
